{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1720; --card:#0b1220; --muted:#98a0af; --accent:#8ee7c3; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --maxw:1100px; --radius:14px; --mono:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, "Roboto Mono", monospace;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial; background-color:var(--bg); color:#e6eef1; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
    header{position:relative;z-index:4;padding:28px 20px;}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#12202a,#18313b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    .nav-links a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:#dff7ee}
    .cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#66d7ff);color:#042226;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}

    /* hero */
    .hero{padding:40px 20px 28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(3,8,12,0.6);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}

    /* contact form */
    form.contact{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:#e6eef1}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .row .col{flex:1}
    .send{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#66d7ff);color:#042226;border:none;cursor:pointer}

    /* side card */
    .side{position:relative}
    .card-small{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .contact-line{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}

    /* proof gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:20px}
    .proof-grid{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .testimonials{flex:1}
    .badge-strip{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0e2d26,#053a2f);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--accent);position:relative;cursor:pointer}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;bottom:56px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#062025;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:#cfeee0;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .18s ease}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-6px)}
    .testimonial-view{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:10px;min-height:92px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#d8f1e8}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:13px}

    /* pricing comparator */
    .price-compare{margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015), transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:12px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .toggle button{background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:#062a20;color:#cfeee0}
    .prices{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    .plan{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(8,15,18,0.4), rgba(2,6,8,0.2));text-align:center}
    .figure{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    .muted-small{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    footer{padding:20px 0;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:13px}

    /* responsive */
    @media(max-width:980px){
      .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .side{order:-1}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav>
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="logo">W</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a href="about.html">Philosophy</a>
          <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
          <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
          <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
          <a href="testimonials.html">Voices</a>
          <a class="cta" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h1>Reach out — we'll create a tidy plan for what matters now</h1>
          <p class="lead">Start with a focused conversation: practical steps, clear habits, and a short path to steady momentum. Use this form or the quick contact line to set the next move.</p>

          <form class="contact" id="contactForm">
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Jane Example" required />
              </div>
              <div class="col">
                <label for="email">Email</label>
                <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="topic">Reason for reaching out</label>
              <select id="topic" name="topic">
                <option>Intro conversation</option>
                <option>Coaching program</option>
                <option>Short intensive</option>
                <option>Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="message">Tell me briefly what you want to change</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Where would you most like to feel different?" required></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;">
              <button type="submit" class="send">Send request</button>
              <div class="muted">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — or email <a style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div id="formMessage" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px"></div>

          <div class="proof">
            <div class="proof-grid">
              <div class="testimonials">
                <div class="testimonial-view" id="testimonialView">
                  <div class="quote" id="quoteText">""</div>
                  <div class="meta" id="quoteMeta"></div>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
                  <div class="badge-strip" id="badgeStrip">
                    <div class="badge" data-tip="Featured in WellLife" tabindex="0">
                      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden>
                        <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" />
                        <path d="M4 20c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                      </svg>
                      <div class="tooltip">Featured in WellLife</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="badge" data-tip="Partner: GreenMind">
                      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden>
                        <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" />
                        <path d="M8 12h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                      </svg>
                      <div class="tooltip">Partner: GreenMind</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="badge" data-tip="As seen on Cohesion" tabindex="0">
                      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden>
                        <path d="M3 12h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <path d="M12 3v18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                      </svg>
                      <div class="tooltip">As seen on Cohesion</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Real voices. Rotating snapshots of recent outcomes.</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="side">
                <div class="card-small">
                  <div style="font-weight:700">Quick contact</div>
                  <div class="muted">Prefer a faster route?</div>
                  <div class="contact-line"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14" stroke="#8ee7c3" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div>{{PHONE}}</div></div>
                  <div class="contact-line"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6" stroke="#66d7ff" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div></div>

                  <div style="margin-top:12px;">
                    <div style="font-weight:700">Compare options</div>
                    <div class="muted-small">Toggle pace and pricing for a quick sense of fit.</div>
                    <div class="price-compare" aria-live="polite">
                      <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Billing toggle">
                        <button id="optOne" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Single</button>
                        <button id="optTwo" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Package</button>
                      </div>
                      <div class="prices">
                        <div class="plan">
                          <div class="muted-small">Session</div>
                          <div class="figure" id="priceA">$0</div>
                          <div class="muted-small" id="priceSubA">/session</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="plan">
                          <div class="muted-small">Pathway</div>
                          <div class="figure" id="priceB">$0</div>
                          <div class="muted-small" id="priceSubB">/package</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px">
                      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
                      <a href="pricing.html" style="color:var(--muted);align-self:center;text-decoration:none">Full details</a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div style="height:10px"></div>
                <div class="card-small" style="margin-top:12px">
                  <div style="font-weight:700">How I work</div>
                  <div class="muted">Focused sequences, regular habits, and measurable next steps. Outcomes framed as daily practices — not one-off promises.</div>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="side" aria-hidden="true">
          <div style="height:28px"></div>
          <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#062a20, #071521);padding:20px;border-radius:14px;min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#8ee7c3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#66d7ff"/></linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="44" stroke="url(#g1)" stroke-width="2" fill="rgba(8,20,16,0.2)"/>
              <path d="M60 28v28l20 12" stroke="#8ee7c3" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Book a focused call</div>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center;margin-top:6px">A short conversation to map a next-step plan and practical habits.</div>
            <a class="cta" href="book.html" style="margin-top:12px">Start a session</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <span class="muted">Designed for steady progress — outcomes, habits, frameworks.</span></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Proof gallery: rotating testimonials
    (function(){
      const samples = [
        {text:'I restructured mornings with a tiny, consistent routine — two weeks in and my energy feels rewired.', who:'L. — product designer'},
        {text:'We turned a tangled schedule into three daily habits I can actually keep. Progress shows up weekly.', who:'R. — entrepreneur'},
        {text:'The short program clarified priorities. I have clearer rituals and less decision fatigue.', who:'M. — teacher'}
      ];
      let i=0; const quoteEl=document.getElementById('quoteText'); const metaEl=document.getElementById('quoteMeta');
      function show(){
        const cur=samples[i%samples.length];
        // fade animation
        quoteEl.style.opacity=0; metaEl.style.opacity=0;
        setTimeout(()=>{
          quoteEl.textContent='"'+cur.text+'"';
          metaEl.textContent=cur.who;
          quoteEl.style.opacity=1; metaEl.style.opacity=1;
        },220);
        i++;
      }
      show(); setInterval(show,4200);

      // badges tooltips accessible
      const badges=document.querySelectorAll('.badge');
      badges.forEach(b => {
        b.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
          const tip=b.getAttribute('data-tip');
          alert(tip);
        });
        b.addEventListener('keypress', (e)=>{ if(e.key === 'Enter') b.click(); });
      });
    })();

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const optOne=document.getElementById('optOne');
      const optTwo=document.getElementById('optTwo');
      const priceA=document.getElementById('priceA');
      const priceB=document.getElementById('priceB');
      const priceSubA=document.getElementById('priceSubA');
      const priceSubB=document.getElementById('priceSubB');

      const plans = {
        single:{a:140,b:0,subA:'/session',subB:'/n/a'},
        package:{a:110,b:700,subA:'/session (avg)',subB:'/4-session pathway'}
      };

      function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
        const startTs = performance.now();
        function tick(now){
          const t = Math.min(1, (now - startTs)/duration);
          const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);
          const val = Math.round(start + (end - start)*eased);
          el.textContent = '$'+val;
          if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }

      function setActive(mode){
        if(mode==='single'){
          optOne.classList.add('active'); optOne.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');
          optTwo.classList.remove('active'); optTwo.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
          animateValue(priceA, parseInt(priceA.textContent.replace(/\D/g,''))||0, plans.single.a, 600);
          animateValue(priceB, parseInt(priceB.textContent.replace(/\D/g,''))||0, plans.single.b, 600);
          priceSubA.textContent = plans.single.subA; priceSubB.textContent = plans.single.subB;
        } else {
          optTwo.classList.add('active'); optTwo.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');
          optOne.classList.remove('active'); optOne.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
          animateValue(priceA, parseInt(priceA.textContent.replace(/\D/g,''))||0, plans.package.a, 600);
          animateValue(priceB, parseInt(priceB.textContent.replace(/\D/g,''))||0, plans.package.b, 600);
          priceSubA.textContent = plans.package.subA; priceSubB.textContent = plans.package.subB;
        }
      }

      optOne.addEventListener('click', ()=> setActive('single'));
      optTwo.addEventListener('click', ()=> setActive('package'));
      // initialize
      setActive('single');
    })();

    // Contact form: client-side mock
    (function(){
      const form=document.getElementById('contactForm');
      const msg=document.getElementById('formMessage');
      form.addEventListener('submit', (e)=>{
        e.preventDefault();
        const name=form.name.value.trim();
        msg.textContent = 'Thanks '+(name||'there')+' — I received your note and will reply within 48 hours. If it is urgent, call '+ '{{PHONE}}' +'.';
        form.reset();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact — wellness_coach-MORE-2026-02-17T03-56-04-404Z-026

This bundle contains the contact page and a small README for the wellness coach template.

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — The full Connect / Contact page.

Placeholders (replace when deploying):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

What this page implements:
- Contact form with local client-side mock response (no backend required).
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials and credibility badges. Badges reveal tooltips on hover and trigger a simple alert on click for keyboard accessibility.
- Pricing Comparator: a toggle between "Single" and "Package" views with animated price transitions.
- Accessible elements: role/tablist and aria-selected usage for the toggle, keyboard support for badges.
- Local-only assets and styling (no external CDNs).

Notes for integration:
- This file expects other site pages to exist: index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html.
- The background pattern SVG is referenced elsewhere as assets/img/pattern.svg; ensure the asset is present with the project.
- Replace placeholders with real values before publishing.

How to preview locally:
1. Place this file alongside the other site files in a folder served by a static server (for example: `python -m http.server` in the folder).
2. Open http://localhost:8000/contact.html

Design/UX notes:
- The copy emphasizes practical habits, outcomes, and short guided paths consistent with the niche rules (no medical claims).
- Navigation labels are intentionally different (Home, Philosophy, Offerings, Programs, Invest, Voices, Book, Connect).

If you need edits to tone, layout, or interactive behavior, tell me what to adjust and I will provide an updated file."}
BUNDLE_END
